      "message": "Merge upstream main (75e74a9cb) into issue/2343-rotary-parallel-held-end (project v72)\n\nOne conflict: examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj. Main moved the\nexample to project version 72 (#2563); this branch changed its cached\nmoves. The file is regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on the merged tree. It\nequals the reviewed file of 15b4344a8 except the version line (71 -> 72).\nThe program golden examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.nc is unchanged.\n\nRefs #2343\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
